### Summary of Key Design Decisions

| Aspect | Decision | Rationale |
|--------|----------|-----------|
| Scene size | ~50 blocks span | Makes find milestones require actual navigation |
| Entity persistence | PersistenceRequired:1b, DespawnDelay:0, NoAI:1b | Prevents trader despawn and llama wandering |
| Trade format | buy=player input, sell=player output | Correct Minecraft trade NBT semantics |
| Sell milestone | Check blue_dye ≤ 3 | Order-independent (works regardless of leather pants trade) |
| Dependency ordering | sell Blue Dye → trade for Leather Pants | Ensures sell milestone triggers before emeralds are spent |
| Find milestones | position_inside_box with tight bounds | More likely supported than position_near_with_facing; requires real movement |
| Tools given | Diamond pickaxe + shears | Pickaxe for stone/brick mining, shears for efficient wool |
| Independent branches | NE (dark oak) and NW (sandstone) | Parallel exploration paths before converging on trading |

